n I'm spider man https://t.co/5ino8Oe8Gn","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2112812337153687658"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","created_at":"2026-10-21T04:05:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112757262410461404"],"id":"2112757262410461404","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":11945,"like_count":51,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":24,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我都说了sub是s，dom是m，你们还不信 https://t.co/K8yO5olaI6","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2112757262410461404"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","created_at":"2026-10-21T03:49:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112753152722432189"],"id":"2112753152722432189","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2260,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2112538616270577839","type":"quoted"}],"text":"还有私信发自我介绍只自我介绍学历身高的。我请问呢我是找主又不是相亲，那你的关系相处模式偏好是什么样的呢？你喜欢哪些玩法呢？你为什么对我感兴趣想当我主呢？我不道啊如果我遇见我了我喜欢的dom，这些我都会说的。谁不喜欢真诚的人。 https://t.co/bUvFAPmd37","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2112753152722432189"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","created_at":"2026-10-21T03:36:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112749913343762750"],"id":"2112749913343762750","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1579,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":0},"text":"如果能够被世界遗忘\n会不会有一天我们也能成为坠入缝隙渴存的那一束光\n须臾久长\n茫茫路途换取归来同往","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2112749913343762750"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","created_at":"2026-10-20T15:06:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112561222646460560"],"id":"2112561222646460560","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2621,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":0},"text":"从我出生开始我每天都在说话，没有人能听得见","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2112561222646460560"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","created_at":"2026-10-20T14:49:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112556878907703312"],"id":"2112556878907703312","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2560,"like_count":12,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"还要那该死的集体活动\n我对集体活动的恐惧从击鼓传花就开始了\n小学的时候被霸凌，所以每次玩击鼓传花的游戏我都对那个花特别畏惧，我很害怕它到我的手里，我不想表演我讨厌表演，我不想去忍受我站起来时全班人的沉默，我只能很窘迫地背一首诗","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2112556878907703312"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","created_at":"2026-10-20T14:37:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112553679245263242"],"id":"2112553679245263242","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2246,"like_count":6,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我操我真的不想开学啊，一想到开学就要面对那该死的拒绝不了的体育节我就想死\n真的想死\n两眼一闭绳子一套就在此圆寂了\n我不想比赛我讨厌体育竞技，我厌恶到一想到就难受想哭又想死\n为什么必须参加为什么必须参加这个世界到底能不能给不喜欢体育竞技的人一点活路\n就必须要死一死吗？","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2112553679245263242"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","created_at":"2026-10-20T14:25:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112550697644478536"],"id":"2112550697644478536","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2104,"like_count":6,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"别看我推文那么可爱活泼其实我是冷脸萌","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2112550697644478536"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","created_at":"2026-10-20T12:45:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112525514724327461"],"id":"2112525514724327461","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3264,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2112467014883369453","type":"quoted"}],"text":"沾沾沾，你们说这个世界上真的有对我一见钟情看完我所有的帖子无法自拔的爱上我，冷脸严厉闷骚腹黑高认知高学历的眼镜男dom吗🤲🏻🤲🏻 https://t.co/mRW8c9azpu","url":"https://x.com/BerryTokkiny/status/2112525514724327461"},{"author_id":"2093646888264478721","created_at":"2026-10-20T11:39:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112509122474299486"],"id":"2112509122474299486","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":3829,"like_count":23,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"text":"中国的九年义务教育到底教育了什么❓\n问你对BDSM的理解，你回答大圈性调教小圈训诫。\n\n